<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-JULY CPI 1.1 PCT MO/MO, 8.7 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-JULY CPI 1.1 PCT MO/MO, 8.7 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuanian consumer prices rose by</p>
<p>a monthly 1.1 percent in July for a year-on-year inflation rate</p>
<p>of 8.7 percent, the statistics department said on Thursday.</p>
<p> LITHUANIAN CPI		  July '97  June 97  July '96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct) +1.1	+0.2     +0.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)   +8.7	+7.6     +24.9</p>
<p>-- Burton Frierson, Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 18</p>
</text>
